    "Apple firmware-locks manual fan control on M3/M4 Pro/Max MacBook Pros running macOS Sequoia and later. No third-party app — including Mystral, Macs Fan Control, or iStat — can override this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple blocca a livello di firmware il controllo manuale delle ventole sui MacBook Pro M3/M4 Pro/Max con macOS Sequoia e successivi. Nessuna app di terze parti può aggirare questa restrizione."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在运行 macOS Sequoia 及更高版本的 M3/M4 Pro/Max MacBook Pro 上，Apple 固件锁定了手动风扇控制。任何第三方软件（包括 Mystral、Macs Fan Control 或 iStat）均无法突破此限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are you sure you want to delete \"%@\"?": {
      "localizations": {
